<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <!--Meta Data-->
    <%- include('partial/title.ejs'); %> 

    <% if (data.NODE_ENV == 'production') { %>
      <!-- Production Stylesheets -->
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/production/css/about.min.css">
    <% } else { %>
      <!-- Development Stylesheets -->
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/bootstrap.min.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/fontawesome.min.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/responsive.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/select2.min.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/spacing.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/style.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/owl.carousel.min.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/bootstrap-datepicker.min.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/lib/css/magnific-popup.css">
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/header.css">
    <% } %>
  </head>

  <body onLoad="typeWriter()">
    <!--Header-->
    <%- include('partial/header.ejs', {data: data }); %>

    <!--About Start-->
    <div class="about-page pt_60 pb_30">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-md-12">
            <h3>Our Mission</h3>
            <p>
              At Carebridge, our mission is to transform the healthcare experience by making quality medical care accessible, affordable, and convenient for everyone. We are dedicated to breaking down the barriers that often complicate healthcare—whether they be logistical, financial, or informational. Through a robust, secure, and user-friendly digital platform, we connect patients with qualified healthcare professionals, enabling seamless appointment booking, real-time communication, and comprehensive management of personal health records.
            </p>
            <p>
              We commit to fostering an environment of trust and transparency, where every user’s privacy and data security are paramount. By integrating innovative technologies and continuously adapting to the evolving needs of patients and providers, Carebridge empowers individuals to take charge of their health journeys confidently. Our platform prioritizes rapid response, personalized care, and patient satisfaction, ensuring that every interaction leads to better health outcomes and enhanced well-being.
            </p>
            <p>
              Ultimately, our mission is to democratize healthcare—removing complexities and delays—so that smart, reliable, and compassionate medical services are within everyone’s reach, regardless of their background or location.
            </p>
            <br>
            <h3>Our Vision</h3>
            <p>
              Our vision at Carebridge is to be a pioneering force in the digital healthcare revolution, setting new benchmarks in how healthcare services are delivered, experienced, and perceived worldwide. We envision a future where healthcare is no longer reactive but proactive, where patients are empowered with comprehensive tools and insights to manage their health before illness strikes.
            </p>
            <p>
              We aspire to build an integrated healthcare ecosystem that seamlessly connects patients, doctors, laboratories, and emergency services, creating a unified network focused on holistic health and wellness. Carebridge aims to eliminate disparities in healthcare accessibility by leveraging cutting-edge technologies such as AI-driven assistance, telemedicine, and secure health data interoperability.
            </p>
            <p>
              By fostering collaboration among medical professionals and continuously enhancing our platform's capabilities, we strive to improve clinical outcomes and patient satisfaction on a global scale. Our commitment is to ensure that quality healthcare is not a privilege but a universally accessible right—making healthcare smarter, faster, and more compassionate for all.
            </p>
            <p>
              Through innovation, integrity, and unwavering dedication, Carebridge will redefine the future of healthcare, enabling healthier lives and stronger communities across the world.
            </p>
            <br>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!--About End-->

    <!--Footer-->
    <%- include('partial/footer.ejs'); %>

    <!-- Developed by students of UIT-RGPV, Bhopal, as a minor project to revolutionize healthcare access -->

    <script>
      var i = 0;
      var txt = 'WELCOME TO Carebridge';
      var speed = 60;
      function typeWriter() {
        if (i < txt.length) {
          document.getElementById("typeit").innerHTML += txt.charAt(i);
          i++;
          setTimeout(typeWriter, speed);
        }
      }
    </script>

    <!-- JavaScript -->
    <script defer src="assets/lib/js/jquery-3.4.1.min.js"></script>
    <script defer src="assets/lib/js/popper.min.js"></script>
    <script defer src="assets/lib/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script defer src="assets/lib/js/all.min.js"></script>
    <script defer src="assets/lib/js/select2.full.min.js"></script>
    <script defer src="assets/js/about.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>